  "title": "Deep Learning for Medical Image Segmentation",
  "abstract": "This project explores the application of deep learning models in segmenting medical images to identify critical regions, such as tumors in MRI scans.",
  "description": "This project explores the application of deep learning models in segmenting medical images to identify critical regions, such as tumors in MRI scans. The research focuses on developing convolutional neural networks (CNNs) and utilizing large datasets to achieve high accuracy and reliability in clinical diagnostics. Our implementation includes custom architecture optimizations for medical imaging data and techniques to address the limited availability of labeled medical datasets through transfer learning and data augmentation approaches.",
