  "title": "IoT-Based Smart Agriculture System",
  "abstract": "This project focuses on developing an Internet of Things (IoT) system for smart agriculture, enabling real-time monitoring of soil conditions, weather, and crop health.",
  "description": "This project focuses on developing an Internet of Things (IoT) system for smart agriculture, enabling real-time monitoring of soil conditions, weather, and crop health. The goal is to optimize resource usage and increase crop yields using advanced sensors and analytics. Our implementation includes a network of low-power sensors, a central gateway for data collection, cloud-based storage and analytics, and a mobile application for farmers to monitor and control their agricultural operations remotely.",
